---
metadata:
  name: Signup form
  params:
    values: {}
    errors: {}
---
{% doc %}
  @param {object} values - Submitted values, echoed back so a rejected form keeps what was typed
  @param {object} errors - Field name to array of translated messages, from modules/user/commands/user/create
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign role = values.role
  unless role == 'host'
    assign role = 'guest'
  endunless
-%}

<div class="authpage">
  <div class="authbox">
    <h1>Create your account</h1>
    <p class="authbox__lead">Rent a workspace, or list one of your own.</p>

    <form action="/signup" method="post" novalidate>
      <input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="{{ context.authenticity_token }}">

      {%- comment -%}
        Role is chosen here and nowhere else. The module's own registration
        pages cannot express this, which is why they are closed off by
        permission and this endpoint exists.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <fieldset class="rolepick">
        <legend>What brings you here?</legend>
        <label class="rolepick__opt">
          <input type="radio" name="role" value="guest"{% if role == 'guest' %} checked{% endif %}>
          <span class="rolepick__title">I need a workspace</span>
          <span class="rolepick__desc">Search desks, meeting rooms and offices near you.</span>
        </label>
        <label class="rolepick__opt">
          <input type="radio" name="role" value="host"{% if role == 'host' %} checked{% endif %}>
          <span class="rolepick__title">I have space to list</span>
          <span class="rolepick__desc">List a desk or office and set your own rates.</span>
        </label>
        {% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_list', name: 'role', errors: errors.role %}
      </fieldset>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="signup-first-name">First name</label>
        <input class="input" type="text" id="signup-first-name" name="first_name" value="{{ values.first_name }}" autocomplete="given-name" required{% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_input_handler', name: 'first_name', errors: errors.first_name %}>
        {% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_list', name: 'first_name', errors: errors.first_name %}
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="signup-last-name">Last name</label>
        <input class="input" type="text" id="signup-last-name" name="last_name" value="{{ values.last_name }}" autocomplete="family-name" required{% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_input_handler', name: 'last_name', errors: errors.last_name %}>
        {% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_list', name: 'last_name', errors: errors.last_name %}
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="signup-email">Email</label>
        <input class="input" type="email" id="signup-email" name="email" value="{{ values.email }}" autocomplete="email" required{% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_input_handler', name: 'email', errors: errors.email %}>
        {% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_list', name: 'email', errors: errors.email %}
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="signup-password">Password</label>
        <div class="input-reveal">
          <input class="input" type="password" id="signup-password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required{% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_input_handler', name: 'password', errors: errors.password %}>
          <button class="input-reveal__btn" type="button" data-reveal="signup-password" aria-label="Show password" aria-pressed="false">
            <svg class="ico-eye" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
            <svg class="ico-eye-off" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" hidden><path d="M3 3l18 18"/><path d="M10.6 5.1A10.9 10.9 0 0 1 12 5c6.4 0 10 7 10 7a18 18 0 0 1-2.4 3.3M6.5 6.6A18 18 0 0 0 2 12s3.6 7 10 7a10.8 10.8 0 0 0 4-.7"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p class="field__hint">At least 6 characters.</p>
        {% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_list', name: 'password', errors: errors.password %}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Provider, site key and secret all come from CAPTCHA_DEFAULT_* constants,
        so there is no key at this call site and swapping provider later is a
        constant change rather than a template change. .authbox__captcha is
        already sized for the v2 checkbox, including the two narrow breakpoints.

        The honeypot and fill timer still belong here, once near_me_antispam
        exists. A captcha alone is not the whole anti-spam story.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="authbox__captcha">
        {% render 'modules/captchas/widget' %}
      </div>
      {% render 'modules/common-styling/forms/error_list', name: 'captcha', errors: errors.captcha %}

      <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" type="submit">Create account</button>
    </form>

    <hr class="authbox__sep">
    <p class="authbox__foot">Already have an account? <a href="/sessions/new">Log in</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .rolepick { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 1.4rem; }
  .rolepick legend { font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: .5rem; padding: 0; }
  .rolepick__opt {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0 .65rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    padding: .75rem .85rem; margin-bottom: .55rem; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .rolepick__opt:has(input:checked) { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--surface-2); }
  .rolepick__opt:has(input:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .rolepick__opt input { margin-top: .2rem; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .rolepick__title { font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: 600; }
  .rolepick__desc { grid-column: 2; font-size: var(--fs-xs); color: var(--muted); }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(function (b) {
    b.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var input = document.getElementById(b.getAttribute('data-reveal'));
      if (!input) return;
      var show = input.type === 'password';
      input.type = show ? 'text' : 'password';
      b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', show ? 'true' : 'false');
      b.setAttribute('aria-label', show ? 'Hide password' : 'Show password');
      var eye = b.querySelector('.ico-eye');
      var off = b.querySelector('.ico-eye-off');
      if (eye && off) {
        if (show) { eye.setAttribute('hidden', ''); off.removeAttribute('hidden'); }
        else { eye.removeAttribute('hidden'); off.setAttribute('hidden', ''); }
      }
    });
  });
</script>
